Now Sentinel uses this for all mercwar repos
In your Sentinel bootstrap (pseudo‑C):

c
SenRepoGraph graph;
SenRepoBindingTable all;

sentinel_init("./", &graph);
sentinel_bindings_all_init(&all);

/* Robot can now: */
SenRepoBinding cyborg;
sentinel_bindings_all_find_by_name(&all, "Cyborg", &cyborg);
/* then sentinel_binding_resolve_directory(graph, cyborg, …) if you wire that in */
If you want, next step I can give you a tiny AVIS script like:

txt
begin.sentinel.boot
    sentinel.init."./"
    sentinel.bind."ALL"
    sentinel.learn.order."CORE,LANGUAGE,TOOLING,EXAMPLE,EXPERIMENT"
end.sentinel.boot
so the robot knows in which order to walk those mercwar repos.
